  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Babylon.MainMenu
  story: 'Babylon, 1750 BC.


    Legends speak of a Sumerian tablet hidden beneath
    the great temple, guarded by traps, riddles and a guardian of living stone.


    Blind
    spiders hunt its halls by sound alone. Tread softly.


    You have come to claim
    it.'
